# Netlify reads this file; it does nothing when the dashboard runs anywhere else.
#
# The dashboard routes in the browser (React Router), so a link straight to a
# page such as /ledger, or a reload on one, must get index.html. Real files in
# dist are served first, so assets are not affected.
#
# A hosted copy has no QWED server behind it, so /api keeps answering 404, as
# it does without this file, instead of returning the page as if it were JSON.
/api/*  /index.html  404
/*      /index.html  200
